***

# ✅ Quick Difference:

| Function               | Purpose                    |
| ---------------------- | -------------------------- |
| `sort()` / `orderBy()` | Sort rows                  |
| `groupBy()`            | Group data for aggregation |

***

# ✅ Simple Understanding:

* `sort()` → "Arrange the rows"
* `orderBy()` → "Arrange the rows" (same as sort)
